THE SCHEDULE
Part I
The medal may be awarded to the following: —
(a)regular members of the Police Force;
(b)volunteer members of the Police Force;
(c)regular members of the Singapore Military Forces;
(d)volunteer members of the Singapore Military Forces on Colour Training Service;
(e)members of the Malayan Royal Naval Volunteer Reserve on List I; and
(f)seconded members of the Malayan and British Armed Forces serving with the Singapore Military Forces.
